{"id":"ccbc16:puzzle:11","answer":"FURUDATE HARUICHI","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我找到了这些中文词，但是不知道下一步","html":"<p>这些词都是同一个集合中的一些元素，你可以试着同时搜索这些词。</p>","text":"这些词都是同一个集合中的一些元素，你可以试着同时搜索这些词。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>将正确颜色的字转换成拼音。</p>","text":"将正确颜色的字转换成拼音。","assetIds":[]},{"number":3,"title":"ft说啥呢？","html":"<p>霓虹就是日本，日本就是nippon，nippon就是立邦</p>","text":"霓虹就是日本，日本就是nippon，nippon就是立邦","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"\n<p>首先需要识别每张图里的内容，题目里给出的中文数字是每个字的笔画数帮助确认答案。我们可以得到：</p>\n<div>\n<span>富</span>\n<span>士</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<span>生</span>\n<span>如</span>\n<span>夏</span>\n<span>花</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<span>布</span>\n<span>达</span>\n<span>拉</span>\n<span>宫</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<span>伏</span>\n<span>特</span>\n<span>加</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<span>哈</span>\n<span>蜜</span>\n<span>瓜</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<span>花</span>\n<span>蕊</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<span>许</span>\n<span>愿</span>\n<span>池</span>\n</div>\n<p>其次是找到这些答案的共同之处。一个办法是把所有的词丢进搜索引擎，取决于搜索引擎，也许可以直接找到需要的网站。另一个办法则是看风味文本里提到的日语里“日本”在nihon之外的另一种发音，也就是nippon。将颜色跟nippon联系起来，可以联想到或者搜到立邦涂料（Nippon Paint）。其实每个词正是立邦油漆颜色的一种，标题里的“七色”不但说的是这里有七种颜色，其实也是谐音“漆色”。所以我们提取符合油漆颜色的字，得到</p>\n<div>\n<span>富</span>\n<span>如</span>\n<span>达</span>\n<span>特</span>\n<span>哈</span>\n<span>蕊</span>\n<span>池</span>\n</div>\n<p>考虑到最后的提取 (8 8)，把汉字转化成拼音可得一位霓虹国漫画家的名字<code>FURUDATE HARUICHI</code>。</p>","text":"首先需要识别每张图里的内容，题目里给出的中文数字是每个字的笔画数帮助确认答案。我们可以得到：\n\n富\n\n士\n\n生\n\n如\n\n夏\n\n花\n\n布\n\n达\n\n拉\n\n宫\n\n伏\n\n特\n\n加\n\n哈\n\n蜜\n\n瓜\n\n花\n\n蕊\n\n许\n\n愿\n\n池\n\n其次是找到这些答案的共同之处。一个办法是把所有的词丢进搜索引擎，取决于搜索引擎，也许可以直接找到需要的网站。另一个办法则是看风味文本里提到的日语里“日本”在nihon之外的另一种发音，也就是nippon。将颜色跟nippon联系起来，可以联想到或者搜到立邦涂料（Nippon Paint）。其实每个词正是立邦油漆颜色的一种，标题里的“七色”不但说的是这里有七种颜色，其实也是谐音“漆色”。所以我们提取符合油漆颜色的字，得到\n\n富\n\n如\n\n达\n\n特\n\n哈\n\n蕊\n\n池\n\n考虑到最后的提取 (8 8)，把汉字转化成拼音可得一位霓虹国漫画家的名字\nFURUDATE HARUICHI\n。","refId":null,"assetIds":[]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{"html":"<style>\n    .psection img {\n        height: 300px;\n    }\n    .enum span {\n        width: 50px;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 10px 0;\n        display: inline-block;\n        border-radius: 0 10px;\n    }\n    .psection {\n        margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"psection\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/0f10073f01774b28abccca0c14119207.webp\">\n    <div class=\"enum\">\n        <span style=\"background-color: #9d5143\">十二</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #64adf0\">三</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"psection\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/d4acaf3a60d746db994b63e43578b189.webp\">\n    <div class=\"enum\">\n        <span style=\"background-color: #935e56\">五</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #e5afbf\">六</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #f9dd89\">十</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #3b8b91\">七</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"psection\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/2ec578e0540d4e9f92bb07ff01613a82.webp\">\n    <div class=\"enum\">\n        <span style=\"background-color: #4c6480\">五</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #b56163\">六</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #f7f963\">八</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #ecd7c4\">九</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"psection\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/65c79fe6ec3b4fcbbfb3e2c96049f6c1.webp\">\n    <div class=\"enum\">\n        <span style=\"background-color: #5e3d4e\">六</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #c1bec4\">十</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #6d9971\">五</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"psection\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/52af02e2a99c4de9a8beabe5517aaabb.webp\">\n    <div class=\"enum\">\n        <span style=\"background-color: #b7c39d\">九</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #fca62e\">十一</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #626900\">五</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"psection\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/8a99b57054a74d5eb4eac9f68df9628b.webp\">\n    <div class=\"enum\">\n        <span style=\"background-color: #d56287\">七</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #e9c271\">十五</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"psection\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/8a08308bde334b2ea15f98bc23c960c7.webp\">\n    <div class=\"enum\">\n        <span style=\"background-color: #80aaba\">六</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #d0b0b1\">十四</span>\n        <span style=\"background-color: #749e87\">六</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>(8 8)</div>"},"sourceMetadata":{"type":1,"answer_type":0,"extend_data":"{\"pid\":11,\"imgUrl\":\"93214d39abc7404c80f4d939785906bf.webp\",\"color\":\"#000\",\"top\":\"490px\",\"left\":\"972px\"}","pgid":1,"pg_name":"序章","resolved_extend_assets":["https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/93214d39abc7404c80f4d939785906bf.webp"]},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-1cdada8e881fcf92a33fd87c","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/d4acaf3a60d746db994b63e43578b189.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/d4acaf3a60d746db994b63e43578b189.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":185600,"sha256":"629f5696f0b1eafff85fd261a0add56e984aa19459d46150d973d0c96765d86c","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["interactive"]},{"id":"asset-1dca15eb68056f0e1ef92640","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/8a08308bde334b2ea15f98bc23c960c7.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/8a08308bde334b2ea15f98bc23c960c7.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":672826,"sha256":"dd620ceb3fb5d7368303d6de49f2a82d4b3f67dde42ff3f8df62d533b2ed7d90","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["interactive"]},{"id":"asset-3023